overriding my honest self.

1058
00:52:37,906 --> 00:52:39,526
You know what I'm saying?

1059
00:52:39,616 --> 00:52:42,116
It's funny. Like, in the moment,
I remember thinking

1060
00:52:42,202 --> 00:52:44,332
